    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d96a7a3a166259928b221834",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人在闪耀系列赛的挑战即将开始。\n目标是追上立于沙土顶点的醒目飞鹰。\n努力爬上这道山坡吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15dd73db409254b7a626b45ee14aa7c3bd049a27b6b92e5abe22270031bbcc9b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100400.json",
