    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc4a56991bf7b30818e833bb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏的疲劳是否源自于严苛的训练？\n为了查证这件事，\n两人决定并跑练习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a600d18822d984019404c7ac01be698a0ae4ed9bb70620506f1fb7be9f2c3c9e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
