    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:170f5e069d23bbe7a53baddd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "并跑练习后，\n好歌剧认为奇锐骏“非常健康”。\n接受比之前更严苛的训练也没有问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e18a1ba445087122e9804f3973aa40014b3b881a9618acababfc72ad55efeb4b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100401.json",
      "json_path": [
