      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但训练员因为过去经验而感到不安。\n他怕过于严苛的训练内容会毁了她，\n也怕自己会犯错……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c41042d82192e7a10d5b3dd981aa33e470c9e46267854f80239b4166edbf902f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
