      "uid": "zhcn:e0aec42840e81c7255541ad5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，\n奇锐骏似乎知道容易疲劳的原因，\n却难以向训练员开口。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e25a3f9ff810670b66bb039a586666cf413429291e2128978221cdf35840fd2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
