    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1cca78cb36e7cf63ee73479",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这么做不是体贴，只是软弱。\n要训练员好好观察对方。\n训练员细细咀嚼这句话，并回到奇锐骏身边──",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3fb3e61346a3b20c28ace78a1987ece2620bcef26155efe6ffe13a54aedc53c",
